# Image builds use the repo root as context (spec 01, D16). Send only what images need:
# each service's Dockerfile adds its own exceptions here.
*
!dbt/
!services/airflow/
# Python services build from the uv workspace: root project, lock file, telemetry and every member's pyproject.
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!telemetry/
!services/store_backend/
!services/store_frontend/
!services/ingest_consumer/

dbt/target/
dbt/logs/
dbt/dbt_packages/
dbt/.user.yml
**/__pycache__/
services/store_frontend/.web/
services/store_frontend/.states/
